# SD
1. Family Doctor is a physical and environmental object.
2. First Intaker is a physical and systemic object.
3. Nursing Officer is a physical and systemic object.
4. Psychiatrist is a physical and systemic object.
5. Second Intaker is a physical and systemic object.
6. Secretarial Office is a physical and systemic object.
7. Team Leader is a physical and systemic object.
8. Dictaphone is a physical and systemic object.
9. Medical File Copy is a physical and environmental object.
10. Personal Notebook is a physical and systemic object.
11. Telephone is a physical and systemic object.
12. Information System is an informatical and systemic object.
13. Medical File is an informatical and environmental object.
14. Medical File can be not required or required.
15. New Notice List is an informatical and systemic object.
16. Patient is a physical and environmental object.
17. Registration Card is a physical and systemic object.
18. Standard Checklist is a physical and systemic object.
19. Assignment List is an informatical and systemic object.
20. Letter is a physical and systemic object.
